`call.split(':')` will split on every colon; if the left-hand side ever contains additional colons, indexing `[1]` can fail or lose data. Use a single split (e.g., split with `maxsplit=1`) and handle the no-colon case to avoid template errors.
```suggestion
      {% set call_split = call.split(':', 1) %}
      {% if call_split|length > 1 %}
      <li>{{call_split[0]}}: <code>{{call_split[1]}}</code></li>
      {% else %}
      <li><code>{{call_split[0]}}</code></li>
      {% endif %}
```

